abstract: >-
  Tokenshark is a pure-Python, browser-based glass-box laboratory for opening,
  inspecting, editing, and training open-weight language and image models
  (Llama, Qwen2/2.5/3/3.6, Mistral, SmolLM, Stable Diffusion, and Qwen-Image DiT)
  without runtime wrapper libraries.
